---
<section class="py-8 sm:py-12 md:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto">
  <div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden relative">
    
    <!-- Subtle background accent blur -->
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-16 -mt-16 w-64 h-64 bg-primary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="p-5 sm:p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 sm:gap-8 items-center md:items-start relative z-10">
      
      <!-- Feature Icon -->
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 relative">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-full bg-canvas-soft-2 border-2 border-hairline shadow-sm overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-8 h-8 sm:w-10 sm:h-10 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="text-center md:text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 bg-canvas-soft-2 text-primary px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          Fit & Comfort Guide
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-4">Why Proper Fit Matters</h2>
        
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-body mb-4 leading-relaxed">
          Wearing a bra that fits correctly provides reliable daily support and all-day comfort. A well-fitted band takes the weight off your shoulders, prevents slipping or digging straps, and ensures your garments sit smoothly against your body.
        </p>

        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-mute leading-relaxed">
          Because body measurements and bra sizing matrices vary across different manufacturers, taking accurate measurements is the most dependable way to establish your baseline size.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
